stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Specify: task arrives
  Specify --> Design: the checker, a separate model call that sees only the task, turns its requirements into checks from the library
  Design --> Bind: the designer writes the solution and tags its items by kind
  Bind --> Evaluate: engine maps the checker's roles onto the designer's kinds
  Evaluate --> Review: report with failures, scope facts, kinds no check touches, faults the checks missed
  Review --> Fix: the designer reviews checks and report, may add checks, any narrowing is logged
  Fix --> Evaluate
  Review --> Finish: nothing violated, every kind covered, every check caught its injected fault
  Finish --> [*]: final message plus the engine's evidence
